I commented on and closed #1245, the only issue on this list that this session's commits fixed (af8cad41).

• What the fix does: under a /spawn worker, a sub-agent's bash now checks rm against its own pinned working folder. Before, it checked against the process folder. So rm -rf <repo>/.yoyo/worktrees/<w> now asks first instead of running. Ordinary sessions behave as before.
